cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository, its search strategy or its retrieved corpus,
  please cite it as below. Cite the tagged snapshot rather than the branch:
  the branch moves, the snapshot is what the registration records point at.
title: >-
  Voice-derived biomarkers across populations, elicitation tasks, modelled
  outcomes and validation maturity: protocol, search strategy and corpus
abstract: >-
  Research compendium for a scoping review and systematic evidence map of
  voice-derived biomarkers, and for the narrower systematic reviews that draw
  on the same corpus. Contains the protocol, the database-specific search
  strategy, the versioned search scripts with their live API contract tests,
  the raw API responses, per source and query-family counts, the screening
  packets, the extraction forms, and the governance logs that record every
  run, deviation and false negative.
